{"itchsRODTEPDtlsDTO":null,"notes":[{"noteId":3.33000283E8,"noteName":"Main","noteDetails":[{"notetype":"Main","policyType":"IMPORT","chapter":"13","noteSerialNo":"1","notes":"<p style=\"text-align:justify\">Heading 1302 applies, inter alia, to liquorice extract and extract of pyrethrum, extract of hops, extract of aloes and opium.<br />The heading does not apply to:</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">(a) liquorice extract containing more than 10% by weight of sucrose or put up as confectionery (heading 1704);</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">(b) malt extract (heading 1901);</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">(c) extracts of coffee, tea or mate (heading 2101);</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">(d) vegetable saps or extracts constituting alcoholic beverages (Chapter 22);</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">(e) camphor, glycyrrhizin or other products of heading 2914 or 2938;</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">(f) concentrates of poppy straw containing not less than 50% by weight of alkaloids (heading 2939);</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">(g) medicaments of heading 3003 or 3004 or blood - grouping reagents (heading 3822);<br />(h) tanning or dyeing extracts (heading 3201 or 3203);</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">(i) essential oils, concretes, absolutes, resinoids, extracted oleoresins, aqueous distillates or aqueous solutions of essential oils or preparations based on odoriferous substances of a kind used for the manufacture of beverages (Chapter 33); or</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">(j) natural rubber, balata, gutta-percha, guayule, chicle or similar natural gums (heading 4001).</p>\n","notificationNo":"08/2023","notificationDate":"29/05/2023","noteSection":"II"},{"notetype":"Main","policyType":"IMPORT","chapter":"13","noteSerialNo":"1","notes":"<p>Heading 1302 applies, inter alia, to liquorice extract and extract of pyrethrum, extract of hops, extract of aloes and opium. The heading does not apply to:</p>\n\n<p>(a) liquorice extract containing more than 10% by weight of sucrose or put up as confectionery (heading 1704); (b) malt extract (heading 1901);</p>\n\n<p>(c) extracts of coffee, tea or mate (heading 2101);</p>\n\n<p>(d) vegetable saps or extracts constituting alcoholic beverages (Chapter 22);</p>\n\n<p>(e) camphor, glycyrrhizin or other products of heading 2914 or 2938;</p>\n\n<p>(f) concentrates of poppy straw containing not less than 50% by weight of alkaloids (heading 2939);</p>\n\n<p>(g) medicaments of heading 3003 or 3004 or blood - grouping reagents (heading 3006);</p>\n\n<p>(h) tanning or dyeing extracts (heading 3201 or 3203);</p>\n\n<p>(i) essential oils, concretes, absolutes,resinoids, extracted oleoresins, aqueous distillates or aqueous solutions of essential oils or preparations based on odoriferous substances of a kind used for the manufacture of beverages (Chapter 33); or</p>\n\n<p>(j) natural rubber, balata, gutta-percha, guayule, chicle or similar natural gums (heading 4001).</p>\n","notificationNo":null,"notificationDate":null,"noteSection":"II"}],"noteSectionDetails":[{"notetype":"Main","policyType":"IMPORT","section":"II","noteSerialNo":"1","notes":"In this Section, the term \"pellets\" means products which have been agglomerated either directly by compression or by the addition of a binder in a proportion not exceeding 3 (percent) by weight.","notificationNo":"","notificationDate":""}]}],"itcCodeClassifications":[{"itcCodeId":null,"unitOfMeasure":null,"itcCode":"1301","itcDescription":"Lac;  natural  gums,  resins,  gum-resins  and  oleoresins  (for example, balsams).","itchswco":"","impPolicy":"","impItcCodeType":"YES","impCondition":"","expPolicy":null,"expItcCodeType":null,"expCondition":null,"notificationNo":"","notificationDate":""},{"itcCodeId":null,"unitOfMeasure":null,"itcCode":"13012000","itcDescription":" Gum Arabic","itchswco":" -","impPolicy":"Free","impItcCodeType":"YES","impCondition":"","expPolicy":null,"expItcCodeType":null,"expConditio